 "remarks": "Brand new luxury 3 bedroom, 1.5 bathroom second floor unit with private deck! This private residence has it's own interior staircase! Gourmet eat in kitchen with chef's stainless steel appliances- gas stove, vented microwave, dishwasher and refrigerator w/ water connection, stone countertops, that opens into sunfilled living area w/ access to deck. Luxury plank flooring throughout! In unit stackable washer/dryer. High efficiency individual split heating and cooling in each room. Master bedroom w/ ample closets and private bathroom, 2 additional generous sized bedrooms with great closet space. Second full bathroom. Access to a shared backyard w/ pavers and outdoor seating/relaxation area. Smartphone controlled bldg intercom and access system. On site parking for an additional fee. Minutes to SONO- train, shops, nightlife, dining, beaches! Pets welcome!",
